    "sub_ename": "THE PRACTICE OF FINANCE (1)",
    "describe_ch": "該課程的目標是把大一至大三課程所學的財金專業知識，予以融會貫通並深化應用。因此，此課程針對財金專業知職作跨領域統整，並進一步應用於金融服務業實際案例。",
    "describe_eh": "This course includes two parts ( I ) Lecture A. Career planning working a attune for financial people. B. Latest company law and shareholder's meeting requirements. C. Prc investment analysis and related laws instruction. D. Offshore company and OBU introduction and practice. E. Corporation mergers and acquisitions practice. F. IPO process in Taiwan & PRC. G. Tax planning procedure. H. The banks financing procedure ( II ) Report the valuation process in Taiwan listed companies.",
